WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,340
The boss of his family is also a healer.

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:04,940
How many vests does he still have?

3
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:06,660
Countdown to seven seconds

4
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:12,480
Countdown to five seconds, four seconds and three seconds

5
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,980
Countdown to two seconds to one second

6
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,060
Countdown ends

7
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:25,740
Self-made program starts

8
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,820
The entire first and second underground floors are going to self-destruct. Hurry up and evacuate.

9
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:39,130
Captain Lu, I killed him

10
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:42,860
Wouldn't you settle this account with us now? Thank you.

11
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:46,460
He only talks about one cubic meter to the outside world
